# WebApi — API only (no UI)

`src/DotNet/Ntk.Asterisk.WebApi` is a **pure HTTP API** host (controllers, SignalR, Swagger, health).

## Forbidden in WebApi

- `wwwroot/` UI / softphone / SPA / HTML pages
- `UseStaticFiles` / `UseDefaultFiles` for product UI
- Razor/Blazor/MVC views serving end-user UI
- Embedding Browser Phone / WebPhone static assets

## Where UI lives

| Surface | Path |
|---------|------|
| Softphone (SipJS Browser Phone) | `src/WebPhone/Ntk.Asterisk.WebPhone` |
| Admin panel | `src/Angular/AdminPanel` |
| User panel | `src/Angular/UserPanel` |

WebPhone calls WebApi over CORS via `WebPhoneUi:ApiBaseUrl` / `phoneOptions.webPhoneApiBase` — never co-host UI under WebApi.

## Agent checklist

When editing WebApi: REST/SignalR/stores only. Softphone changes → `src/WebPhone/`.
